#: ../../source/components_basic/21-component_i2c_lcd1602.rst:129
msgid "Library Inclusion and LCD Initialization: The LiquidCrystal I2C library is included to provide functions and methods for LCD interfacing. Following that, an LCD object is created using the LiquidCrystal_I2C class, specifying the I2C address, number of columns, and number of rows."
