#: ../../source/components_basic/21-component_i2c_lcd1602.rst:140
msgid "Setup Function: The ``setup()`` function is executed once when the Arduino starts. In this function, the LCD is initialized, cleared, and the backlight is turned on. Then, two messages are displayed on the LCD."
msgstr ""

